  "id": "callosum",
  "term": "callosum",
  "definition": "In this context, the callosum refers to the corpus callosum, a major white-matter pathway made of interhemispheric commissural fibers. It links the two sides of the brain and is part of the structural networks discussed in mood disorders.",
